notes.content:
Today we share with you what is ready at the moment, so that you can evaluate the readiness of our game for yourself.

[h2][b]So, now it's ready:[/b][/h2]
- The entire UI is rendered and debugged, but there will be additional elements;
- Fully debugged core gameplay of the game;
- The game mode on a single device is fully functional and configured;
- All game settings work;
- Developed a system of ranks and ratings;
-The system of online duels works;
- Player profile works, rank display, name change works;
-All 3d models, textures and animations are ready;
- Bugs are caught and debugged.

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/40311623/b9ce39bcc22f17b68bc5e7e7d62221f3b4b9b62d.png[/img]

[h2][b]What is being done and will be ready soon:[/b][/h2]
- Sync player actions in multiplayer;
- Additional visual effects;
- Debugging the rating system and ranks for multiplayer;
- Add animated dice to visualize throws;
- Catching new bugs.
